# Lowest compiler that must build the code: the CI's (GitHub's macos-26 machines, Xcode 26). With 6.4, SwiftFormat
# writes `any P?`, which Swift 6.3 and earlier refuse.
--swift-version 6.2
--language-mode 6
--indent 4
--max-width 140
--exclude build,DerivedData
# Same version as the CI (.github/workflows/check.yml): a newer one brings new rules.
--minversion 0.64.0
